NO LICENSE IS GRANTED. This repository is shared for EVALUATION AND REVIEW ONLY.

You may read this code, run it, and form a judgment about it. You may not
redistribute it, publish it, or use it or any derivative of it for any other
purpose without written permission from the copyright holder.

The absence of an open-source license is deliberate rather than an oversight.
This code is part of an active research program; the copyright position and the
licensing position have not been settled, and granting rights now -- in
particular granting patent rights -- would foreclose decisions that are not the
authors' alone to make. An open release is intended once that is resolved. Until
then "all rights reserved" is the honest statement of where this stands, and it
is stated here, at the filename a reader looks for, rather than left to the
default that applies when a repository carries no license file at all.

This repository vendors nothing and imports nothing beyond the Python standard
library, so there are no third-party licenses to enumerate. The fold engine whose
command line this code constructs is a separate program, not included here, and
carries its own terms from its own distributor.
